1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 42=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:44,640 --> 00:01:46,280
I've always loved you with all my heart.

7
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:52,519
Now that we have a child,

8
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:57,719
surely you can tell me
where they came from.

9
00:02:15,340 --> 00:02:19,460
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

10
00:02:22,420 --> 00:02:26,380
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

11
00:02:28,380 --> 00:02:31,900
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

12
00:02:32,620 --> 00:02:35,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

13
00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:38,420
♪Though all the world may fade♪

14
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:41,260
♪Time rolls on
as countless lives rush by♪

15
00:02:42,759 --> 00:02:45,840
Little toes, let's stretch them.

16
00:02:46,439 --> 00:02:48,680
Stretch them all the way to Nanshan.

17
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:52,280
There's a treasure in Nanshan.

18
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,560
The treasure has a mountain of gold.

19
00:02:56,719 --> 00:03:00,759
And on that mountain
lie 1.2 hectares of fields.

20
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:05,479
0.5 hectares are planted with buckwheat.

21
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:10,719
The buckwheat feeds the little chicks.

22
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:15,280
But the little chicks won't eat.

23
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,599
Have you forgotten, Young Master?

24
00:03:19,912 --> 00:03:22,328
You brought them
back to the residence yourself,

25
00:03:26,904 --> 00:03:28,840
yet you're asking me
where they came from.

26
00:03:33,940 --> 00:03:38,140
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

27
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:44,940
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

28
00:03:46,900 --> 00:03:50,500
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

29
00:03:51,180 --> 00:03:53,740
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

30
00:03:54,900 --> 00:04:00,580
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

31
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:05,140
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

32
00:04:05,140 --> 00:04:08,300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

33
00:04:08,660 --> 00:04:12,260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

34
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,940
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

35
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:19,340
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

36
00:04:19,340 --> 00:04:22,340
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

37
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:26,340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

38
00:04:26,340 --> 00:04:30,420
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

39
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,600
I just saw Jinqi rush out.

40
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:39,959
Is something wrong?

41
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:42,959
Old Master needed to see him urgently.

42
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:45,839
Look.

43
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:47,480
Someone's hungry.

44
00:04:48,879 --> 00:04:50,120
No more sucking on your hand,
Zhangcheng.

45
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,439
Zhangcheng is awake.

46
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,160
Let me hold her.

47
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:57,220
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

48
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:02,620
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

49
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:06,060
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

50
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:12,780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

51
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:38,319
You came here all worked up,

52
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:41,639
yet you haven't said
a word since you arrived.

53
00:05:46,639 --> 00:05:48,000
I remember Grandfather

54
00:05:48,296 --> 00:05:50,200
was never
particularly fond of Li Yingqiu.

55
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,920
So why

56
00:05:52,632 --> 00:05:54,840
do you cherish
this Cold Mountain Painting so much?

57
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,319
Even during festivals,

58
00:05:58,152 --> 00:05:59,830
instead of spending time
with the family,

59
00:06:00,296 --> 00:06:01,992
you keep this painting by your side,

60
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:05,360
as though

61
00:06:07,752 --> 00:06:09,430
you were sitting with an old friend.

62
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,439
Now

63
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:26,160
that you're a father, too,

64
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:29,639
there are some things
I can finally tell you.

65
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:33,360
This Cold Mountain Painting

66
00:06:39,240 --> 00:06:42,199
was a treasured piece
in Grand Secretary Shen's collection.

67
00:06:55,688 --> 00:06:57,720
After the Shen family
was stripped of its property,

68
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,920
by a twist of fate,

69
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:03,199
your father-in-law recognized its worth

70
00:07:03,759 --> 00:07:05,120
and acquired it for his shop.

71
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:07,720
Only then did I
have the chance to see it again.

72
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:26,959
No wonder.

73
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,079
Now, seeing you siblings

74
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:08,600
raise families and live well,

75
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:14,199
I don't regret choosing
to save my own life back then.

76
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:20,800
But in the end, I failed to preserve
my integrity in my later years.

77
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:26,199
I failed the teachings of the sages,

78
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:32,639
and Grand Secretary Shen's faith in me.

79
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:50,480
I remember

80
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,600
you once arranged a marriage

81
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,840
between me and Young Lady Shen Jialan.

82
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,720
What kind of

83
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:03,120
young lady was she?

84
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,559
I met her once

85
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,480
when she was six.

86
00:09:11,879 --> 00:09:15,240
Pure and unspoiled,
with a natural air of grace.

87
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:18,240
Though she was a girl,

88
00:09:18,919 --> 00:09:19,960
Grand Secretary Shen

89
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:23,720
treasured her dearly
and taught her with great care.

90
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,799
That's all in the past.

91
00:09:29,544 --> 00:09:30,968
There's no need to speak of it now.

92
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,559
Grandfather.

93
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,200
I still have letters to answer.

94
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:44,000
I'll take my leave.

95
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:53,559
(Grand Secretary Shen Qihan.)

96
00:09:53,848 --> 00:09:56,184
(For deceiving the sovereign
and betraying imperial favor,)

97
00:09:56,216 --> 00:09:58,030
(and for disloyalty
in matters of state,)

98
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:02,480
(all male members
of the Shen family are to be executed.)

99
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:06,799
(The women are to be enslaved
in the Imperial Music Bureau.)

100
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:10,600
(All property is to
be confiscated by the state.)

101
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:14,159
You lie beneath the earth,
your bones turned to dust.

102
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:19,120
I remain in this world,
my hair white as snow.

103
00:10:25,679 --> 00:10:27,440
I remain in this world,

104
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:32,720
my hair white as snow.

105
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:47,300
(Created by Li Yingqiu of Heyang)

106
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,399
Young Madam.

107
00:11:15,399 --> 00:11:16,639
Why bring a brazier in here

108
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,559
in the middle of summer?

109
00:11:19,304 --> 00:11:20,480
Young Master asked for it.

110
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,919
I was too blinded by appearances.

111
00:11:58,679 --> 00:11:59,919
From beginning to end,

112
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,480
I was the one who wronged you.

113
00:12:07,919 --> 00:12:09,320
You never wronged me.

114
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:51,580
(Zhichun Hall
Daily Expense Account Book)

115
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:50,519
You are Xu Lanxiang.

116
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:53,879
We

117
00:13:54,648 --> 00:13:56,910
are husband and wife
who share every sorrow and joy,

118
00:13:58,559 --> 00:14:01,120
and face every fortune
and misfortune together.

119
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:21,660
♪The golden sunset♪

120
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:25,020
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

121
00:14:26,780 --> 00:14:29,260
♪All things fall silent♪

122
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:32,820
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

123
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:36,580
♪My restless heart♪

124
00:14:36,580 --> 00:14:40,220
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

125
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:46,900
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

126
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:50,919
You...

127
00:14:51,112 --> 00:14:51,910
Aren't you afraid?

128
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:55,639
Can I save up all the credit and ask

129
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:57,760
for everything at once
when I've decided what I want?

130
00:15:01,399 --> 00:15:03,960
I have to go.

131
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,736
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

132
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,080
As long as we care,

133
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:12,399
our bond will never be broken.

134
00:15:12,400 --> 00:15:14,584
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

135
00:15:15,159 --> 00:15:16,120
I have feelings for Lady Xu.

136
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,840
I wish to marry her.

137
00:15:18,159 --> 00:15:19,159
From this day forward,

138
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,320
we are husband and wife,
sharing both fortune and misfortune.

139
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,000
Stop!

140
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,240
Prefect Liu, are you trying

141
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:25,096
to indirectly
cause my husband's death today?

142
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,120
I'm no gentleman.

143
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:31,919
I get scared.

144
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:34,120
I act on impulse.

145
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:36,559
But for as long as I live,

146
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,080
I will never betray you.

147
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:41,100
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

148
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:45,060
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

149
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:51,380
♪You and I will walk there together♪

150
00:16:03,380 --> 00:16:04,820
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

151
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:14,720
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

152
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,728
Before Fourth Young Lady's
bridal gift ceremony,

153
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:17,960
the First Madam

154
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:21,840
discovered a dark patch on her abdomen.

155
00:16:22,559 --> 00:16:24,080
It had ulcerated and begun to bleed.

156
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:27,320
She secretly sent for a physician,

157
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:30,679
who said it was a malignant sore

158
00:16:31,919 --> 00:16:33,440
and there was no cure.

159
00:16:36,120 --> 00:16:38,080
The First Madam kept it from everyone

160
00:16:39,176 --> 00:16:40,630
and strictly ordered Yinchen and me

161
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,919
not to breathe a word of it.

162
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:50,919
That's impossible.

163
00:16:52,248 --> 00:16:54,776
The physician you found
must have been incompetent.

164
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:04,130
The Treatise on the Origins
and Symptoms of Diseases states,

165
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:09,000
"When a sore itches, aches,
burns, swells, and oozes profusely,

166
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:10,640
accompanied by a high fever,

167
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,039
it is known as a malignant sore."

168
00:17:13,368 --> 00:17:14,440
It is difficult to heal

169
00:17:14,696 --> 00:17:15,790
and difficult to treat.

170
00:17:16,488 --> 00:17:17,960
If it develops on the hands or feet,

171
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,839
amputation

172
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:21,880
may offer a slim chance of survival.

173
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:25,400
But when it develops on the abdomen...

174
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:28,839
The infection has now spread
deep into her internal organs.

175
00:17:29,759 --> 00:17:33,319
Your Lordship, you should make funeral
arrangements as soon as possible.

176
00:17:52,599 --> 00:17:54,119
I have failed you as a son.

177
00:17:55,359 --> 00:17:56,960
You were unwell,

178
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,079
yet I never noticed.

179
00:18:02,839 --> 00:18:03,640
It seems

180
00:18:05,359 --> 00:18:07,480
experience still wins out in the end.

181
00:18:11,880 --> 00:18:13,319
You little rascal.

182
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,319
In the end, you still can't escape

183
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,680
the Buddha's palm.

184
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,839
How could my little schemes

185
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,880
ever compare with your great wisdom?

186
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,799
Birth, aging, illness, and death

187
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:56,279
are inevitable parts of life.

188
00:18:58,039 --> 00:18:59,759
You're with child.

189
00:19:01,319 --> 00:19:03,279
You may grieve for me,

190
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:07,119
but you mustn't let yourself
be consumed by sorrow

191
00:19:07,400 --> 00:19:09,279
and harm your health.

192
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,119
Otherwise,

193
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,599
even after I'm gone,

194
00:19:19,319 --> 00:19:21,279
I'll never be at peace.

195
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,079
I understand.

196
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,279
Taking good care of myself

197
00:19:31,359 --> 00:19:33,079
and living well

198
00:19:35,319 --> 00:19:36,920
will be the greatest way

199
00:19:38,559 --> 00:19:40,119
to honor you.

200
00:19:43,319 --> 00:19:47,160
That's the daughter I raised.

201
00:20:00,599 --> 00:20:01,759
Lanxiang.

202
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:10,559
Mother.

203
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,160
Jinqi

204
00:20:16,079 --> 00:20:19,079
knows what he's doing.

205
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,359
I don't worry about him.

206
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:24,119
The only one

207
00:20:25,039 --> 00:20:27,599
I can't stop worrying about is Xiushu.

208
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,319
This world

209
00:20:31,359 --> 00:20:33,319
is harsh on women.

210
00:20:36,279 --> 00:20:38,960
But seeing how you treat Xiulai,

211
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,079
Xiuru,

212
00:20:42,039 --> 00:20:43,319
and Suhua,

213
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:48,920
I can finally put my mind at ease.

214
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,359
Don't worry, Mother.

215
00:20:53,519 --> 00:20:55,400
I've watched Xiushu grow up.

216
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:58,319
I will never let anyone mistreat her.

217
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:08,119
Ever since you
married into the Lin family,

218
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:13,920
because of your background,

219
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:19,079
I've always treated you coldly.

220
00:21:25,319 --> 00:21:27,519
I was foolish.

221
00:21:28,440 --> 00:21:30,079
I've wronged you.

222
00:21:34,319 --> 00:21:35,960
Though you never cared for me,

223
00:21:36,792 --> 00:21:39,260
you never treated me harshly
or made things difficult for me.

224
00:21:40,079 --> 00:21:42,920
Instead, you often stood up
for me before the elders.

225
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:47,039
Even if you only did it
for Young Master's sake,

226
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:48,790
I still benefited from your kindness

227
00:21:50,519 --> 00:21:51,680
and have always been grateful.

228
00:22:08,559 --> 00:22:11,200
These are the household
authority tokens.

229
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,920
From now on,

230
00:22:17,960 --> 00:22:18,960
the Lin Residence

231
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:22,000
is in your hands.

232
00:22:34,599 --> 00:22:36,400
My Xiushu

233
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:38,359
is also entrusted

234
00:22:39,599 --> 00:22:40,160
to you...

235
00:22:47,799 --> 00:22:48,359
Mother.

236
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,119
Mother...

237
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:54,720
Mother.

238
00:23:59,279 --> 00:23:59,880
Mother!

239
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:00,839
Mother!

240
00:24:01,480 --> 00:24:02,400
Mother!

241
00:24:03,519 --> 00:24:04,440
Grandmother!

242
00:24:04,839 --> 00:24:05,960
Aunt Shunhua!

243
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:06,880
Mother!

244
00:24:09,799 --> 00:24:10,839
Aunt Shunhua!

245
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:13,780
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

246
00:24:14,220 --> 00:24:19,820
♪Each plant endures
its own trials before reaching shore♪

247
00:24:20,180 --> 00:24:23,180
♪Flowers drift with the ties of fate♪

248
00:24:23,180 --> 00:24:26,540
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

249
00:24:26,540 --> 00:24:32,300
♪Yet their proud spirit
fades with wind and snow♪

250
00:24:32,300 --> 00:24:35,580
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

251
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:38,620
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

252
00:24:38,620 --> 00:24:44,180
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

253
00:24:44,380 --> 00:24:50,100
♪Spring comes, and I smile
upon a garden in full bloom♪

254
00:24:50,460 --> 00:24:56,420
♪Autumn passes,
and I let the blossoms fade away♪

255
00:24:56,780 --> 00:25:00,580
♪A scroll of time slowly unfolds♪

256
00:25:00,580 --> 00:25:09,300
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

257
00:25:10,920 --> 00:25:12,880
First Madam!

258
00:25:13,640 --> 00:25:14,960
First Madam!

259
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:16,319
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

260
00:25:16,319 --> 00:25:17,640
First Madam!

261
00:25:18,079 --> 00:25:19,440
It's broad daylight.

262
00:25:19,450 --> 00:25:21,150
Why are you wailing
as if someone has died?

263
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:22,440
How utterly improper.

264
00:25:25,519 --> 00:25:26,240
Master.

265
00:25:27,920 --> 00:25:29,559
The First Madam has passed away.

266
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:49,319
Changzheng.

267
00:25:51,160 --> 00:25:52,559
Shunhua is gone.

268
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:56,839
Shunhua...

269
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:01,359
is gone.

270
00:26:03,559 --> 00:26:06,400
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

271
00:26:08,079 --> 00:26:09,279
With such a large household,

272
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:12,880
now there's no one
to manage its affairs.

273
00:26:14,359 --> 00:26:16,119
But Aunt Shunhua's funeral

274
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:17,920
still needs to be arranged.

275
00:26:19,039 --> 00:26:21,119
This is far too important to neglect.

276
00:26:22,599 --> 00:26:23,200
If

277
00:26:24,359 --> 00:26:25,680
it isn't handled properly,

278
00:26:26,359 --> 00:26:27,519
Uncle Changzheng

279
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:30,559
will lose face as well.

280
00:26:34,519 --> 00:26:35,519
In the past,

281
00:26:36,359 --> 00:26:37,680
all the affairs of the residence

282
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,680
were handled by your Aunt Shunhua.

283
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:41,920
But...

284
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:43,319
now,

285
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:45,960
what are we supposed to do?

286
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:49,920
Shunhua and I were as close as sisters.

287
00:26:50,759 --> 00:26:51,920
She was gravely ill,

288
00:26:53,759 --> 00:26:55,839
yet she never told me a thing.

289
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,079
And now,

290
00:27:03,976 --> 00:27:06,350
she's even left the household
in the Young Madam's hands.

291
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:13,759
After all these years as sisters,

292
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:21,079
she didn't trust me at all.

293
00:27:23,599 --> 00:27:26,039
It breaks my heart.

294
00:27:26,519 --> 00:27:27,920
Lanxiang was born a servant,

295
00:27:28,599 --> 00:27:30,680
so her knowledge
and experience are limited.

296
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,839
She's never dealt
with anything this important.

297
00:27:34,559 --> 00:27:37,079
She's bound to make mistakes

298
00:27:37,599 --> 00:27:39,079
and make a laughingstock of herself.

299
00:27:41,480 --> 00:27:43,960
Why don't you leave
Aunt Shunhua's funeral

300
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,720
to me?

301
00:27:51,559 --> 00:27:52,599
You have a point.

302
00:27:53,839 --> 00:27:54,799
I'll leave it to you.

303
00:27:55,096 --> 00:27:56,056
You can handle it.

304
00:27:59,079 --> 00:27:59,720
All right.

305
00:27:59,800 --> 00:28:01,480
Mother already
made all the arrangements.

306
00:28:03,599 --> 00:28:04,799
Father, you needn't worry.

307
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:10,319
You must be beside yourself with grief.

308
00:28:10,519 --> 00:28:12,279
Your mother has already passed away.

309
00:28:12,400 --> 00:28:15,000
How could she have arranged
her own funeral?

310
00:28:15,519 --> 00:28:16,359
Exactly.

311
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:19,200
Everyone in the Lin Residence
can only rely on me now.

312
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,279
Fengxian,

313
00:28:29,119 --> 00:28:31,559
may I ask which feng shui master
in the city we should hire?

314
00:28:34,759 --> 00:28:35,160
Well...

315
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:38,400
How would I know

316
00:28:39,279 --> 00:28:40,319
on such short notice?

317
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:42,440
The First Madam
already chose a feng shui master.

318
00:28:42,960 --> 00:28:43,920
Head Butler Yang,

319
00:28:44,119 --> 00:28:46,400
take some men
with Young Master's calling card at once

320
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:48,200
and invite Mister Zuo
from Bajiao Street.

321
00:28:48,440 --> 00:28:49,119
Yes.

322
00:28:51,839 --> 00:28:52,920
Fengxian,

323
00:28:53,256 --> 00:28:55,224
where are the First Madam's
burial clothes?

324
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:58,119
Who will dress her in them
for the initial encoffining?

325
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:01,240
Aunt Shunhua passed away so suddenly.

326
00:29:01,250 --> 00:29:03,256
How could she possibly
have burial clothes ready?

327
00:29:03,830 --> 00:29:05,144
Shouldn't we hurry and buy them?

328
00:29:14,168 --> 00:29:16,790
The First Madam's burial clothes
are in the rear house attic,

329
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,680
inside the largest camphorwood chest.

330
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:21,160
Wei, take some people
and bring them here.

331
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:22,440
Yes.

332
00:29:26,160 --> 00:29:26,839
Madam Wu.

333
00:29:28,728 --> 00:29:30,030
Once the burial clothes arrive,

334
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,559
please help me

335
00:29:33,279 --> 00:29:34,720
dress the First Madam in them.

336
00:29:36,039 --> 00:29:36,839
Let us attend to her

337
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:38,480
one last time.

338
00:29:40,839 --> 00:29:41,960
Rest assured, Young Madam.

339
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:53,799
Xiulai,

340
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:55,359
Mother's coffin

341
00:29:55,608 --> 00:29:57,640
is in the right-side room
behind the family shrine.

342
00:29:58,359 --> 00:29:59,799
Take a few careful servants

343
00:29:59,896 --> 00:30:01,016
and have them carry it over.

344
00:30:01,128 --> 00:30:02,070
Keep a close eye on it.

345
00:30:02,328 --> 00:30:03,992
Don't let it get so much
as a single bump.

346
00:30:06,790 --> 00:30:07,832
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

347
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:13,759
Xiuwan.

348
00:30:14,359 --> 00:30:15,039
Suhua.

349
00:30:16,910 --> 00:30:19,130
Mother also had the mourning clothes
and funeral banners

350
00:30:19,144 --> 00:30:20,088
prepared in advance.

351
00:30:20,279 --> 00:30:22,319
They're against
the left wall in the storeroom.

352
00:30:22,552 --> 00:30:24,030
Take some people and bring them out,

353
00:30:24,072 --> 00:30:25,110
and then distribute them.

354
00:30:25,688 --> 00:30:26,920
- All right.
- All right.

355
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,119
Lanxiang.

356
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,039
What can I do?

357
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:47,000
I'll leave what Mother cared about most

358
00:30:47,640 --> 00:30:48,880
to you, Xiuru.

359
00:30:50,200 --> 00:30:53,080
There will be many people and much
to attend to during the funeral.

360
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:54,279
Xiuru, please

361
00:30:54,680 --> 00:30:56,240
be sure to take good care of Xiushu.

362
00:31:01,039 --> 00:31:02,119
Don't worry, Lanxiang.

363
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:04,799
I'll make sure Mother can rest in peace.

364
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,160
Once the feng shui master arrives

365
00:31:13,368 --> 00:31:15,200
and sets the time
for the final encoffining

366
00:31:15,272 --> 00:31:16,840
and the date of the funeral procession,

367
00:31:17,270 --> 00:31:19,944
have Jinqiao and Jincen go to each
residence to announce the death.

368
00:31:20,072 --> 00:31:22,440
That will give our relatives
and friends time to prepare.

369
00:31:24,920 --> 00:31:25,359
All right.

370
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:27,759
Then I...

371
00:31:30,632 --> 00:31:31,830
Mother has pain in her chest.

372
00:31:32,920 --> 00:31:34,240
I'll take her back to rest first.

373
00:31:38,344 --> 00:31:39,240
Let's go, Mother.

374
00:31:39,599 --> 00:31:40,400
Shunhua...

375
00:31:47,240 --> 00:31:47,680
Father.

376
00:31:48,872 --> 00:31:50,536
So, is everything properly arranged?

377
00:31:51,599 --> 00:31:53,000
If anything is amiss,

378
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:55,400
please correct me.

379
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:57,599
I wouldn't...

380
00:32:01,352 --> 00:32:02,472
Everything is in order.

381
00:32:02,808 --> 00:32:03,736
Everything is in order.

382
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:08,480
Since your mother put you
in charge of the household,

383
00:32:09,079 --> 00:32:10,440
do your best.

384
00:32:11,599 --> 00:32:12,599
Your grandfather

385
00:32:13,359 --> 00:32:14,799
must be grieving terribly.

386
00:32:15,400 --> 00:32:17,119
I'll go keep him company.

387
00:32:22,460 --> 00:32:26,740
(Banyan Terrace and Gracious Shade)

388
00:32:32,980 --> 00:32:39,100
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

389
00:32:39,100 --> 00:32:43,540
(Spirit Tablet
of Madam Qin of the Lin Family)

390
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:48,839
I was only following Mother's wishes

391
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:50,824
and saying whatever
I could to reassure Master.

392
00:32:53,480 --> 00:32:55,039
How do you know everything?

393
00:32:56,279 --> 00:32:57,400
You even know exactly

394
00:32:59,432 --> 00:33:00,790
where the burial clothes are.

395
00:33:28,200 --> 00:33:29,480
(For the feng shui master,)

396
00:33:30,039 --> 00:33:32,480
(invite Mister Zuo from Bajiao Street.)

397
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:37,480
(The burial clothes are in the attic
of the rear house at Rongzhang House,)

398
00:33:38,039 --> 00:33:39,920
(inside the largest camphorwood chest.)

399
00:33:41,519 --> 00:33:45,200
(The coffin is in the right-side room
behind the family shrine.)

400
00:33:47,039 --> 00:33:48,359
(During the initial encoffining,)

401
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:52,880
(Lanxiang and Madam Wu
will dress me in the burial clothes.)

402
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:59,480
(Once the time for the final encoffining
and the funeral date are set,)

403
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:03,240
(go to each residence
to announce the death,)

404
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:07,160
(so our relatives and friends)

405
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:09,320
(have time to prepare.)

406
00:34:10,100 --> 00:34:13,580
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

407
00:34:15,020 --> 00:34:18,100
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

408
00:34:19,180 --> 00:34:23,540
♪Birds carry twigs into the distance♪

409
00:34:23,540 --> 00:34:26,860
♪While two pairs
of eyes watch from below♪

410
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,800
Give this to me.

411
00:34:34,340 --> 00:34:37,740
♪Snow falls white upon the eaves♪

412
00:34:38,740 --> 00:34:43,300
♪Four seasons wax and wane,
year after year♪

413
00:34:43,300 --> 00:34:46,500
♪Whose footsteps come and go?♪

414
00:34:47,620 --> 00:34:50,580
♪You're a river flowing to shore♪

415
00:34:51,400 --> 00:34:53,039
Thank you for persuading me to resign

416
00:34:53,280 --> 00:34:54,440
and return to Jinling.

417
00:34:56,039 --> 00:34:58,039
Only then could I stay by Mother's side

418
00:34:58,568 --> 00:35:00,110
and fulfill some of my duty as her son.

419
00:35:01,519 --> 00:35:02,039
Otherwise,

420
00:35:02,760 --> 00:35:04,440
I'd still be in the capital now,

421
00:35:05,280 --> 00:35:07,280
and I'm afraid I wouldn't
even have seen Mother

422
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:09,760
one last time.

423
00:35:12,020 --> 00:35:15,220
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

424
00:35:16,260 --> 00:35:20,620
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

425
00:35:20,670 --> 00:35:23,256
It was also because you
were willing to listen, Young Master.

426
00:35:28,280 --> 00:35:30,039
Mother was a wise woman.

427
00:35:32,119 --> 00:35:33,800
She and Father didn't get along,

428
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:36,960
but she never took it out
on the younger generation.

429
00:35:39,239 --> 00:35:41,719
Xiulai, Xiuru,

430
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:42,960
and Jinlan

431
00:35:43,719 --> 00:35:45,880
were never neglected

432
00:35:46,920 --> 00:35:48,599
in manners, learning, or upbringing.

433
00:35:49,752 --> 00:35:51,510
They all have
very different personalities,

434
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:55,480
but they are all good at heart.

435
00:35:58,519 --> 00:36:00,719
Ever since I was little, Mother told me

436
00:36:01,880 --> 00:36:03,719
that one tree alone
cannot make a forest.

437
00:36:07,592 --> 00:36:09,480
I had to treat
my younger siblings sincerely

438
00:36:11,960 --> 00:36:14,000
for them to treat me
sincerely in return.

439
00:36:18,039 --> 00:36:19,079
She also told me

440
00:36:21,039 --> 00:36:22,039
that Xiuru

441
00:36:23,360 --> 00:36:24,960
may seem gentle but is strong-willed,

442
00:36:29,440 --> 00:36:31,440
so Xiushu should
spend more time with her,

443
00:36:35,039 --> 00:36:36,400
lest she be left alone

444
00:36:38,639 --> 00:36:39,719
to dwell on things

445
00:36:41,159 --> 00:36:42,119
and go astray.

446
00:37:03,599 --> 00:37:04,440
Just cry.

447
00:37:07,719 --> 00:37:09,159
As children,

448
00:37:12,328 --> 00:37:13,720
we wish to care for our parents,

449
00:37:14,456 --> 00:37:16,392
but they may be gone
before we have the chance.

450
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:26,199
I'll cry with you.

451
00:37:28,900 --> 00:37:33,700
♪Even if these trials
consume my whole life♪

452
00:37:34,100 --> 00:37:38,260
♪I'll only return
to the moment our fate began♪

453
00:37:38,660 --> 00:37:41,900
♪I've searched and searched,
wandering in circles♪

454
00:37:41,900 --> 00:37:44,900
♪Yet I can never mend that old dream♪

455
00:37:45,260 --> 00:37:47,820
♪Leaving only regret behind♪

456
00:37:48,260 --> 00:37:52,740
♪Thankfully, these trials
have spared me a lifetime♪

457
00:37:53,020 --> 00:37:58,140
♪In this life and the next,
it will always be you♪

458
00:37:58,780 --> 00:38:07,140
♪I only pray that fate
lets us meet sooner♪

459
00:38:16,440 --> 00:38:18,580
Aunt Shunhua must have
been delirious from her illness

460
00:38:18,599 --> 00:38:19,880
and misled by that servant.

461
00:38:20,744 --> 00:38:21,630
Mother is kindhearted,

462
00:38:21,640 --> 00:38:23,690
but you can't just let that servant
do as she pleases.

463
00:38:24,679 --> 00:38:26,480
Aunt Shunhua cared about her dignity.

464
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,840
We can't let her become

465
00:38:28,400 --> 00:38:29,912
a laughingstock even after her death.

466
00:38:31,159 --> 00:38:32,840
When I gave birth to Jincen,

467
00:38:34,280 --> 00:38:35,280
I had a difficult labor.

468
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:39,719
It was Shunhua who sent for a physician

469
00:38:41,400 --> 00:38:43,400
and stayed by my side the entire time.

470
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:45,360
She practically

471
00:38:45,800 --> 00:38:48,920
pulled me back from the brink of death.

472
00:38:52,400 --> 00:38:54,079
Mother, you mustn't
let Aunt Shunhua down.

473
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:55,920
You must keep the Lin family together.

474
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:00,800
But Shunhua...

475
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:05,800
Shunhua already put the Young Madam
in charge of the household.

476
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:10,840
There's still Old Master.

477
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,400
As long as Old Master gives the word,

478
00:39:13,280 --> 00:39:15,280
that servant has no right
to run the Lin family.

479
00:39:25,260 --> 00:39:28,260
(Legacy and Glory)

480
00:39:33,880 --> 00:39:34,679
Aunt Lanxiang.

481
00:39:41,400 --> 00:39:42,960
Why have you come to the family shrine?

482
00:39:43,440 --> 00:39:44,760
Why aren't you with Mother?

483
00:39:45,100 --> 00:39:48,159
(Lu Jun, age 15. Lu Yingzhi, age 11
Lin Xiulai's son and daughter)

484
00:39:48,159 --> 00:39:49,159
We have something

485
00:39:49,368 --> 00:39:50,670
to tell you, Aunt Lanxiang.

486
00:39:57,810 --> 00:40:00,040
What is it that's so important
that you need to tell me?

487
00:40:09,119 --> 00:40:10,599
Aunt Fengxian gave these to us.

488
00:40:11,976 --> 00:40:14,520
These are ritual vessels
used for offerings to your grandmother.

489
00:40:14,639 --> 00:40:15,559
How did you get it?

490
00:40:16,599 --> 00:40:18,320
Madam Deng, who serves Aunt Fengxian,

491
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:20,079
gave this to Yingzhi.

492
00:40:20,800 --> 00:40:21,559
She told Yingzhi

493
00:40:22,000 --> 00:40:23,360
to secretly hide it in your chest

494
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,400
where you keep your personal clothes.

495
00:40:26,519 --> 00:40:29,039
Madam Deng said that
now that the First Madam is gone,

496
00:40:29,640 --> 00:40:30,920
from now on, the Lin Residence

497
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:33,239
will be managed by the Second Madam,

498
00:40:33,368 --> 00:40:35,230
which means Aunt Fengxian
will be in charge.

499
00:40:35,719 --> 00:40:37,360
If I obediently do as I'm told,

500
00:40:37,528 --> 00:40:39,840
we'll be allowed to continue staying
at the Lin Residence.

501
00:40:40,559 --> 00:40:41,800
If I don't,

502
00:40:42,639 --> 00:40:45,239
she'll drive all three of us out

503
00:40:46,119 --> 00:40:47,639
and leave us homeless on the streets.

504
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:52,960
Aunt Fengxian not only looks down on us,

505
00:40:52,970 --> 00:40:55,210
but she has also looked down
on you too, Aunt Lanxiang.

506
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:57,760
Why don't we give her

507
00:40:58,360 --> 00:40:59,760
a taste of her own medicine?

508
00:41:00,280 --> 00:41:02,440
I'll slip this jade into
Aunt Fengxian's room

509
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:03,840
without her knowing...

510
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:04,920
Absolutely not.

511
00:41:06,536 --> 00:41:08,910
Why shouldn't we let a wicked person
suffer the consequences

512
00:41:08,920 --> 00:41:10,119
of her own actions?

513
00:41:11,639 --> 00:41:12,960
What Aunt Fengxian did to me

514
00:41:13,199 --> 00:41:14,039
was wrong.

515
00:41:14,559 --> 00:41:15,639
If I do the same thing,

516
00:41:16,320 --> 00:41:17,679
wouldn't that make me just like her

517
00:41:17,784 --> 00:41:19,288
and turn me into a wicked person, too?

518
00:41:20,056 --> 00:41:21,550
If we repay resentment with kindness,

519
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:24,000
what do we repay kindness with?

520
00:41:31,880 --> 00:41:32,280
Come here.

521
00:41:35,119 --> 00:41:35,480
Sit down.

522
00:41:42,632 --> 00:41:43,760
Let me ask you something.

523
00:41:44,719 --> 00:41:45,880
What do the two of you

524
00:41:46,679 --> 00:41:47,719
live for?

525
00:41:56,480 --> 00:41:58,360
I live for my parents,

526
00:41:59,280 --> 00:42:01,559
for my daughter Zhangcheng,

527
00:42:02,280 --> 00:42:04,119
and above all, for myself.

528
00:42:18,960 --> 00:42:21,840
For the tender yellow-green
shoots of spring,

529
00:42:24,440 --> 00:42:26,079
the evening breeze and stars of summer,

530
00:42:30,376 --> 00:42:32,150
the blue skies and red leaves of autumn,

531
00:42:33,640 --> 00:42:35,688
and the white snow
and red plum blossoms of winter.

532
00:42:39,079 --> 00:42:41,639
For the first fresh
river catch I taste each year.

533
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:43,800
For pumpkins, sweet and soft.

534
00:42:47,736 --> 00:42:50,136
For the fireworks and firecrackers
on Chinese New Year's Eve.

535
00:42:51,592 --> 00:42:54,030
For the wonderful plays performed
by the Furong Troupe.

536
00:42:57,880 --> 00:42:59,719
